    { "id": "lane-during", "page": "page-1", "x": -300, "y": 1300, "w": 240, "text": "DURING THE NIGHT\n\nOne figure is live and one is final. Nothing has come off the table yet — every result here is out less in." },
    { "id": "lane-closing", "page": "page-1", "x": -300, "y": 2350, "w": 240, "text": "CLOSING IT\n\nThe three-step wizard. Step 2 applies the rules, step 3 hands out the transfers — and a night that does not balance skips step 2 entirely and lands on screen 6." },
    { "id": "lane-after", "page": "page-1", "x": -300, "y": 3400, "w": 240, "text": "AFTERWARDS\n\nRead back weeks later, by somebody who cannot ask the host. This is where “why is my number this” has to be answered without a tap." },
    { "id": "cut-note", "page": "page-2", "x": -300, "y": 60, "w": 240, "text": "None of this is an arithmetic bug. Every figure is one tested engine call. What repeats is the saying of it." }
